{# twig template #}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block page_content %}

    {% embed 'layouts/right-sidebar.html.twig' %}

        {% block layout_page_title %}
            {{ 'Gutter Cleaning in Middle Georgia' }}
        {% endblock %}

        {% block layout_main_content %}
            <div class="col-12">

                <p>We provide professional gutter cleaning throughout Middle Georgia using commercial vacuum equipment designed to clean gutters safely without walking on your roof. We proudly serve homeowners in Byron, Warner Robins, Macon, Perry, Fort Valley, and surrounding communities.</p>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    {% include 'components/image-carousel.html.twig' %}
                </div>

                <p>The difference starts with how we clean gutters. Instead of climbing onto your roof with ladders, we use commercial vacuum equipment to clean your gutters safely from the ground whenever possible.</p>

                <p>We use a high-powered vacuum system to suck the gobs of dirt and leaves out of your gutters. It's commercial-grade, and is powerful enough to pull root systems out of your gutters. Yes, we've seen trees growing in gutters!</p>

                <p>We can even record the cleaning using a wireless HD camera so you can <a class="text-link font-weight-bold" href="" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#vacuum-vid-modal">see the results for yourself.</a></p>

                {# Call Now #}
                <div class="jumbotron jumbotron-fluid bg-white">
                    <div class="container">
                        <p class="lead">Ready for Clean Gutters?<span class="mr-2 ml-2"></span><a class="btn btn-danger btn-md" href="tel:1-{{ company_phone }}" role="button">Call Now</a></p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                {# Checklist #}
                <h2>What To Expect</h2>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li class="mb-3">
                        <p class="display-6 d-inline text-primary">
                            <i class="fa fa-check text-danger"></i>
                            &emsp;Get in Touch
                        </p>
                        <p class="mt-2 ml-5">
                            Call us or fill out the quote form and we'll schedule a convenient time to inspect your gutters.
                        </p>
                    </li>

                    <li class="mb-3">
                        <p class="display-6 d-inline text-primary">
                            <i class="fa fa-check text-danger"></i>
                            &emsp;Receive Your Quote
                        </p>
                        <p class="mt-2 ml-5">
                            We'll inspect your gutter system, answer any questions, and provide a straightforward quote before any work begins.
                        </p>
                    </li>

                    <li class="mb-5">
                        <p class="display-6 d-inline text-primary">
                            <i class="fa fa-check text-danger"></i>
                            &emsp;We'll Handle the Rest
                        </p>
                        <p class="mt-2 ml-5">
                            Once you approve the work, we'll clean your gutters and you can pay online, by check, cash, or credit card.
                        </p>
                    </li>
                </ul>

            </div>

        {% endblock %}

        {% block layout_sbr %}
            {% include 'components/forms/quote-request.html.twig' %}
            <div class="w-100 mb-3"></div>
            {% include 'components/testimonials.html.twig' %}
        {% endblock %}

    {% endembed %}

    {% include 'components/modals/vacuum-video.html.twig' %}

{% endblock %}
